        "cnm_p183"
      ],
      "explanation": "Dividing by the nonzero fraction \\(\\frac{2}{5}\\) means multiplying by its reciprocal, \\(\\frac{5}{2}\\). Therefore\n\\[\n6 \\div \\frac{2}{5} = 6 \\times \\frac{5}{2} = \\frac{30}{2} = 15.\n\\]",
